"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな少女漫画教えて～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、お気に入りの作品ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たいようのいえ\nとなりの怪物くん\nアオハライド\n花と落雷\nすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日買った\n星屑クライベイビー\n紙に穴があくまでじっくり読もう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろくまりっくま先輩は\nこの個人PVについてなんか言ってた？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかけだるそうにしてたけど、\n内心出演できて\nめっちゃ嬉しかったみたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小説は読みますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読む。\nこれからは漫画と同じように\n積極的に読もうと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理想のロマンチックなデートは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"散歩\n地味って思われがちだけど、\nロマンティックだと私は思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"助っ人は急にお願いされたの？\nそれともやることは決まっていたの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急にお願いされました。\nしかし...役に立てて良かったです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ見てない方のために\n答えは言いません。さがしてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＰＶって何回くらいＮＧ出したの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7回...くらい？\nケーキと定期...←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監督が違うと撮影の雰囲気とか\n全然ちがったりするの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然違います。\nすごい勉強になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘッドホンまりかの私物なの?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華は古本買うの？\nそれとも立ち読み？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気に入ったら買うけど、\n主に立ち読み。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな色が好き？春と言えば何色？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欲張りだが、全色。\nマイブームはいろんな緑。\nくすんだ色もすき。\n春は薄いピンクのイメージ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなドラマは何ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SPEC"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな妄想するのか、\nよければ教えてください(^ω^)ﾆﾔﾆﾔ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"果てしないロマンティック←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画何冊持ってる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"50冊くらいかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に少女漫画読む男の子って\nどう思いますか？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう思う...？\n読むのは恥ずかしいこと\nではないと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5thでいちばん好きな楽曲は何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君の名は希望"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズムのＭＶで注目して\nもらいたい場面はどこですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的にすきなのは\nラストのガラス越しの生駒。\nモニターを見つめる風紀委員。\nあ、まりおは掃除のシーンで\n雑巾掛けしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりおは生駒の友人です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/14/6682716/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}}